| `cors()` with whitelist | Prevents any website from freely consuming your API. |
| `morgan` logging | Gives you request tracing, essential for detecting abuse. |
| `express-rate-limit` | Throttles abusive clients, mitigating DoS and credential‑stuffing. |
| `express.json()` | Guarantees the body is parsed as JSON before validation. |
| Validation middleware (`express-validator`) | Guarantees that incoming data conforms to expectations, mitigating injection attacks. |
| Central error handler | Guarantees a single place to handle errors, to hide stack traces from clients, and to optionally attach correlation IDs for debugging. |
