## 6. Use HTTPS / enforce TLS (if you ever expose the server)

Even in development, it’s good practice to redirect HTTP to HTTPS (or at least set the `secure` flag on cookies). With Express you can add:

```js
app.enable('trust proxy'); // needed when behind a reverse proxy
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  if (req.secure) {
    return next();
  }
  res.redirect(`https://${req.headers.host}${req.url}`);
});
```

