const PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;
```

### 1.2 Centralised Error‑Handling Middleware  
Express will treat any thrown error (synchronous or asynchronous) as an unhandled exception unless a dedicated error handler is added.

```js
// After all route definitions, before app.listen()
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  // Log the error (you could plug in winston, pino, etc.)
